{"chapter":{"blocks":[{"text":"第 8 章 贪婪算法","type":"TITLE"},{"text":"本节学习：第 8 章 贪婪算法。讲义保留原有示例与练习，可结合正文向教师提问。","type":"PARAGRAPH"},{"text":"贪婪算法的思路：每一步都选当前看起来最好的，不后悔。比如找零钱：能拿大面额就拿大面额。\n\n例子：你要凑 36 元零钱，贪婪算法会先拿 20，再拿 10，再拿 5，再拿 1——共 4 张。对人民币面额来说这就是最优解。\n\n但贪婪不一定总是最优，只是简单好用。","type":"MARKDOWN"}],"grade_max":9,"grade_min":7,"knowledge_points":[{"description":"学习并解释「第 8 章 贪婪算法」中的核心概念与示例。","name":"第 8 章 贪婪算法","slug":"junior-algorithms-topic-08","topic":"计算机与人工智能"}],"license_code":"UNKNOWN","objectives":["解释「第 8 章 贪婪算法」的主要概念，并结合示例完成文中练习。"],"order_index":16,"revision":1,"slug":"ch-008-main","source":{"conversion":"supplied-markdown-v1","original_sha256":"09e83bcf6259f4f82e3e416e41e9a578ee64da7b91682842ca2e11c11c4be4d9","source_commit":null,"source_path":"sources/09e83bcf6259f4f8/02-算法图解.md"},"stage":"JUNIOR","title":"第 8 章 贪婪算法"},"content_hash":"d5ecf28ebf570014d562bdc4477f167bf53df95ef7827306ab636aba0d2dae78","course":{"slug":"junior-algorithms","title":"算法图解","topic":"计算机与人工智能"},"is_test_fixture":false,"manifest_hash":"b2500e5121455aa9339fe6399902e89a0917eaf9bd814708a6dc69af397b6b20","release_key":"computing-ai-md-v1-db6ffb6b663b","schema_version":"k12.content.revision-snapshot.v1","source_kind":"NEW_SOURCE"}
